<onlyinclude>This '''outline of machine learning''' maps the principal learning settings, model families, mathematical foundations, evaluation practices and deployment concerns in machine learning.

== Explanation ==
A beginner can start with examples of labeled training data, learn how a model is fitted, and then test it on separate data. Other approaches discover patterns without labels or learn through rewards. The right approach depends on the problem.

